Procurement &amp; supplier management &nbsp;

• Order products in line with our product BOM and as requested by the wider team &nbsp;

• Work with the Product Development and Production teams to&nbsp;anticipate purchasing needs, and ensure products arrive on time and meet our quality requirements &nbsp;

• Track orders through to delivery and resolve any delays or issues &nbsp;

• Research, evaluate and onboard new suppliers &nbsp;

• Regularly benchmark suppliers and pricing, and identify alternative suppliers to reduce cost and supply risk &nbsp;

• Negotiate pricing, contract terms and supplier agreements &nbsp;

• Build and maintain strong relationships with key suppliers &nbsp;

• Improve our procurement processes as the organisation grows &nbsp;

• Keep accurate records of orders, contracts and supplier details &nbsp;

• Work with the Workshop Technicians to maintain an accurate stock system, so that the inventory levels are always up to date and records are audit-ready. &nbsp;

Logistics &nbsp;

